# Caddy config. SITE_ADDRESS comes from .env.
#
# On a real VPS with a PUBLIC IP, set SITE_ADDRESS to <public-ip>.sslip.io and
# DELETE the `tls internal` line: Caddy then fetches a trusted Let's Encrypt
# certificate automatically, no domain purchase required.
#
# On a private/lab box (no public IP, so Let's Encrypt cannot validate) keep
# `tls internal` and Caddy serves HTTPS with its own local CA.
{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
	tls internal
	reverse_proxy app:3000
}
